# 06: SONG. Scenes playing, a cell copied and pasted with R1, the mixer.
title THE SONG SCREEN
about Scenes, not a timeline: the song plays its scenes in turn. R1 copies a cell and R1 on another pastes it; hold A on a track's head for its level and pan.
caption SONG
run --demo --view song
from 0.4
length 22.0

0.6 say SONG: scenes down, tracks across.
3.4 say R1 copies a cell.
3.6 tap R1
4.6 tap DOWN 3 0.35
6.0 say R1 on another pastes it. Scene 4 plays.
6.2 tap R1
8.6 say Up from scene 1: the track's head.
8.6 tap RIGHT 2 0.3
9.4 tap UP 4 0.25
11.0 say Hold A: the mixer. Up, down: level.
11.0 hold A 5.6
11.8 tap DOWN 5 0.2
13.6 say Left, right: pan.
13.6 tap LEFT 4 0.25
15.0 tap RIGHT 2 0.25
17.4 say A changed track: a brass square.
